    "Whoever opens this link joins straight in as %@, without picking from the list, and already sees their %@ share in the %lld bills added so far. It works once." : {
      "comment" : "Explains a member's personal invite link when bills already give them a part; the first %@ is the member, the second their parts, %lld how many bills",
